      "options": {
        "content": "### Privacy-First Agent Observability\n\n- **Service Name**: `gemini-healthcare-agentic-platform`\n- **Tempo Trace Search**: Open the **Explore** tab in Grafana, select the **Tempo** datasource, and search for traces by Service Name or Trace ID.\n- **Protected Telemetry**: Traces capture operational metadata only (agent lifecycle, model latency, retrieval counts). Sensitive patient queries, prompts, LLM answers, and FHIR data are stripped before export.\n\n#### Direct Links\n- [Grafana Explore (Tempo)](/explore?left=%5B%22now-1h%22,%22now%22,%22Tempo%22,%7B%7D%5D)\n- [Prometheus Targets](http://localhost:9090/targets)\n- [Streamlit Healthcare UI](http://localhost:8501)",
